# Ordinary polynomial/rational fits on well-behaved intervals.
approx sin(x) in -pi/2..pi/2 degree 5..9 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx cos(x) in 0..pi/2 relative norational nosplit list 2
approx exp(x) in 0..1 degree 4 as f32 list 1
approx atan(x) in -1..1 degree 5 as f32 list 1
approx tanh(x) in 0..1 degree 3 as f32 list 1
approx sqrt(x) in 0..1 degree 2 nosplit noreduce list 1
approx 1/sqrt(x) in 0.01..100 ulp 2 nosplit norational list 2
